---
# The checks cpp-linter used to pass on the command line (its default
# tidy-checks), now kept here so local runs, pio check and CI agree.
Checks: >-
  boost-*,
  bugprone-*,
  performance-*,
  readability-*,
  portability-*,
  modernize-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  cppcoreguidelines-*
FormatStyle: file
